                        "review": "This game is awesome, its like a bite-sized cozy 2D minecraft that is equally weird and comical - a delight to play. Theres over 10 characters - each quite different to play as, each run is randomized, theres a mix of hand-crafted worlds with procedurally placed/swapped extra pieces.\r\n\r\nWhile the game is very much feature complete and has tons of content, I think it still has potential for even more content and rebalancing some items to be more useful to the player than just remain purely cosmetic. I think the crafting system is too rigid/shallow since its the same for all characters instead of each character having their own set of things they can make, meanwhile the player cannot tech-up through crafting by getting access to advanced crafting stations without first finding them out in the world.\r\n\r\nCombat is a light and fun too and the game is very fair and relaxing overall, its a game I can see myself coming back to do a run again and again.\r\n\r\nI love the achievements as extra tasks the player can pursue during runs, but wish there were more of them.\r\n\r\nI highly recommend this game, its easily worth many hours of goofy fun that is both deep but also doesn't take itself too seriously, letting humor and oddities from the silly situations bring happiness as I adventure in this game.",
